# Content placement (section and type)

## Definitions

- **Section** is the first folder under `content/` (for example `platform/`). It sets the URL prefix and which list pages include the page. Home feed sections are listed in **`hugo.toml`** under `params.home.posts.contentSections`.
- **`type`** is front matter. It selects layouts and required fields. MUST pick **section intent first**, then **`type`**.
- **Taxonomy `categories`** (for example **`Platform`**, **`Lineage`**, **`Proof`**, **`Notes`**) label topics and hub pages. They **do not** have to mirror the section folder name.

## Pick the section (folder)

Use the **main job of the piece**, not hashtags or browsing context.

| Put it under | When the core of the post is |
|--------------|-------------------------------|
| **`platform/`** | Principals, grants, ledgers, surfaces, and how agents are authorized to act and remember. Usual types: **`claims`**, **`opinion`**. |
| **`lineage/`** | Coordinates, retrieval, grounding, memory policy, and auditable provenance. Usual types: **`claims`**, **`opinion`**. |
| **`proof/`** | DSS-EVAL, benchmarks, limits, and evidence that ties claims to measurement. Usual types: **`claims`**, **`video`**. |
| **`notes/`** | Shipping notes, operator updates, and shorter editorial pieces. Usual types: **`opinion`**, **`claims`**. |
| **`about/`** | Static about page only (not a post section). |
| **`cognitive-memetics/`** | Panel, sayings, and satire machinery when explicitly used. Omitted from default home bands and main menu until editorial needs it. |

### `type: video` (YouTube picks)

- MUST follow **`.cursor/skills/site-video-content/SKILL.md`**.
- MAY live under **`proof/`** (default for evaluation-focused picks) or another section when the spine clearly fits **platform** or **lineage**.

### MUST NOT

- MUST NOT put DSS product essays in **`cognitive-memetics/`** unless the piece is panel/sayings/satire by design.
- MUST NOT use legacy Behaviour Engineering section folder names (`mind-infrastructure`, `social-protocols`, `human-condition`, `x-minds`) in new bundles.

## Pick the `type`

| `type` | Section(s) | Use when |
|--------|------------|----------|
| **`claims`** | `platform/`, `lineage/`, `proof/`, `notes/` | **Claim** (`description`), **Grounding** (`grounding`), optional **Thoughts** body. Follow **`.cursor/skills/site-claims-content/SKILL.md`**. |
| **`opinion`** | `platform/`, `lineage/`, `proof/`, `notes/` | Full **stanceful essay**. Follow **`.cursor/skills/site-opinion-content/SKILL.md`**. Essay MCP: **`content_form=opinion_essay`**. |
| **`panel`** | `cognitive-memetics/` | Strip or panel content. Follow **`.cursor/skills/site-cognitive-memetics-content/SKILL.md`**. |
| **`sayings`** | `cognitive-memetics/` | Sayings pattern. Follow **`.cursor/skills/site-cognitive-memetics-content/SKILL.md`**. |
| **`video`** | `proof/` (usual), `platform/`, `lineage/` | YouTube pick. Follow **`.cursor/skills/site-video-content/SKILL.md`**. |

## Categories

- Prefer **`Platform`**, **`Lineage`**, **`Proof`**, or **`Notes`** aligned with the section.
- **`cognitive-memetics`**: Use umbrella **`Cognitive-Memetics`** plus hub categories per **`.cursor/skills/site-cognitive-memetics-content/SKILL.md`**.

## Quick checks

- Claim-shaped mechanism post → pick section by spine, **`type: claims`**.
- Stanceful essay → same section choice, **`type: opinion`**.
- After **any** new bundle, folder rename/move, or **`date`** / **`draft`** change → **`go tool task calendar`** (see **`.cursor/rules/site-content-markdown-writing.mdc`** → **Publish calendar**).
